{
    "default_outer_template": {
        "subject": "Email from Default Outer Template",
        "body": "<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC \"-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN\"\r\n\"http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd\">\r\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\r\n<head>\r\n<title>integralzen.org</title>\r\n<meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1\" />\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div>\r\n\t\t*!**mail_body**!*\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>"
    },
    "event_bulk_footer": {
        "subject": "Email from Event Bulk Footer",
        "body": "<br/>----\r\n<br/>\r\n{evr_event_registrant_id}This email was sent to {~recipient}you{end}{recipient}*recipient->usr_email*{end} because you are registered for an event or course.  To unsubscribe, you must withdraw from the event or course here:  <a href=\"*web_dir*/profile/event_withdraw?evr_event_registrant_id=*evr_event_registrant_id*&user=*recipient->key*&*email_vars*\">unsubscribe</a>.  \r\n{end evr_event_registrant_id}\r\n\r\n{~evr_event_registrant_id}\r\n\tThis email was sent to you because you're registered for this course.  If you would like to withdraw from the course, visit the \"My Profile\" section of the site <a href=\"*web_dir*/profile?&*email_vars*\">here</a>.\r\n{end ~evr_event_registrant_id}\r\n\t<br/><br/>\r\n\tIntegral Zen\r\n<br/>\r\n<br/>"
    },
    "activation_content": {
        "subject": "Integral Zen Verification Link",
        "body": "<p>Hi *recipient->usr_first_name*,</p>\n{~resend}\n<p>Thanks for signing up on Integral Zen!  Please click on this link to verify your email address:</p>\n{end}\n{resend}\n<p>Please click on the following link (or copy it into your browser) to verify your email address:</p>\n{end}\n<p>\n\t<a href=\"*web_dir*/login?act_code=*act_code*&*email_vars*\">*web_dir*/login?act_code=*act_code*</a>\n</p>\n<p>Thanks,</p>\n<p>Integral Zen</p>"
    },
    "new_account_content": {
        "subject": "Welcome to Integral Zen!",
        "body": "<p>Hi *recipient->usr_first_name*,</p>\n<p>I want to sincerely welcome you to our sangha.</p>\n<p>All of your course and event registrations, links, and recurring donations are available in the <a href=\"https://integralzen.org/profile\">\"My Profile\" section of the website</a> (click \"My Profile\" in the top right).\n{password_temporary}\n<p>We have created a password for you:  <strong>*password*</strong></p>\n{end}\n{~password_temporary}\n<p>Your password is:  <strong>*password*</strong></p>\n{end}\n<p>We have resumed in-person retreats, but here are also some things you can do remotely on our site (integralzen.org):</p>\n<p>\n<ul>\n<li>Sign up for our newsletter to get notified of online events</li>\n<li>Start joining us on our <a href=\"https://integralzen.org/event/28/Sunday-Integral-Dharma-Calls\">Sunday Dharma calls</a>.  (Also, there are about three months of Sunday calls archived in the My Profile section of the website to get you caught up).</li>\n<li>Our <a href=\"https://integralzen.org/event/37/The-Whole-Spectrum-of-Shadows-Self-paced-Course-Level-1\">Level 1 self-paced Whole Spectrum of Shadows course</a> has been released.  </li>\n<li><a href=\"https://integralzen.org/offerings/scheduling/\">Book an appointment</a> with one of Doshin's priests for an introduction to Integral Zen.  You can go over your meditation practices and get basics and advice.</li>\n<li>We have a reading list on the website that you can browse.  I would highly recommend anything by Ken Wilber, \"The Method of No Method\", and \"The Body Keeps the Score\" for trauma.  This will give you a map of how we're putting everything together.</li>\n<li>Also, we are always planning retreats, so stay tuned.</li>\n</ul>\n</p>\n<p>If there's anything that we can help with that isn't listed here, please let us know.</p>"
    },
    "forgotpw_content": {
        "subject": "Integral Zen Password Change Link",
        "body": "<p>Hi *recipient->usr_first_name*,</p>\n<p>You have requested a password change on IntegralZen.org. Please click on the link below (or copy it into your browser) to complete the process.</p>\n<p><a href=\"*web_dir*/password-reset-2?act_code=*act_code*&*email_vars*\">*web_dir*/password-reset-2?act_code=*act_code*</a>\n<p>Thanks,</p>\n<p>IntegralZen</p>\n<p>P.S.  For security purposes, this link will expire in 24 hours or when this link is used.</p>"
    },
    "email_change_content": {
        "subject": "Integral Zen Email Change Verification",
        "body": "<p>Hi *recipient->usr_first_name*,</p>\n<p>Please click on this link to complete the change of your email address to *new_email*:</p>\n<p>\n\t<a href=\"*web_dir*/email_change?act_code=*act_code*&*email_vars*\">*web_dir*/email_change?act_code=*act_code*</a>\n</p>\n<p>Thanks,</p>\n<p>Integral Zen</p>"
    },
    "newsletter-1": {
        "subject": "*subject*",
        "body": "<!doctype html>\n<html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:v=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:vml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n        <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n        <title>*subject*</title>\n        \n</head>\n    <body>\n        <center>\n            <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" height=\"100%\" width=\"100%\" id=\"bodyTable\">\n                <tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" id=\"bodyCell\">\n                        <!-- BEGIN TEMPLATE // -->\n                        <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\">\n                            <tr>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" id=\"templatePreheader\">\n                                    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"templateContainer\">\n                                        <tr>\n                                            <td valign=\"top\" class=\"preheaderContainer\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnTextBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnTextBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnTextBlockInner\" style=\"padding-top:9px;\">\n                <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:390px;\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnTextContentContainer\">\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        \n                        <td valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnTextContent\" style=\"padding-top:0; padding-left:18px; padding-bottom:9px; padding-right:18px;\">\n                        \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n                \n                <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:210px;\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnTextContentContainer\">\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        \n                        <td valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnTextContent\" style=\"padding-top:0; padding-left:18px; padding-bottom:9px; padding-right:18px;\">\n                        \n                           <!-- <a href=\"*|ARCHIVE|*\" target=\"_blank\">View this email in your browser</a>-->\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnImageBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnImageBlockOuter\">\n            <tr>\n                <td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:0px\" class=\"mcnImageBlockInner\">\n                    <table align=\"left\" width=\"100%\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"mcnImageContentContainer\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n                        <tbody><tr>\n                            <td class=\"mcnImageContent\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-right: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-top: 0; padding-bottom: 0; text-align:center;\">\n                                \n                                    <a href=\"https://integralzen.org/\" title=\"\" class=\"\" target=\"_blank\">\n                                        <img align=\"center\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://integralzen.org/theme/integralzen/emailtemplates/newsletter-1-assets/Integral-zen-email-logo.png\" width=\"414\" style=\"max-width:414px; padding-bottom: 0; display: inline !important; vertical-align: bottom;\" class=\"mcnImage\">\n                                    </a>\n                                \n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody></table>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table></td>\n                                        </tr>\n                                    </table>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" id=\"templateHeader\">\n                                    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"templateContainer\">\n                                        <tr>\n                                            <td valign=\"top\" class=\"headerContainer\"></td>\n                                        </tr>\n                                    </table>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" id=\"templateBody\">\n                                    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"templateContainer\">\n                                        <tr>\n                                            <td valign=\"top\" class=\"bodyContainer\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnImageCardBlock\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnImageCardBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"mcnImageCardBlockInner\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-top:9px; padding-right:18px; padding-bottom:9px; padding-left:18px;\">\n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnDividerBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnDividerBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"mcnDividerBlockInner\" style=\"min-width: 100%; padding: 18px;\">\n                <table class=\"mcnDividerContent\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width: 100%;border-top-width: 4px;border-top-style: solid;border-top-color: #222222;\">\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        <td>\n                            <span></span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n<!--            \n                <td class=\"mcnDividerBlockInner\" style=\"padding: 18px;\">\n                <hr class=\"mcnDividerContent\" style=\"border-bottom-color:none; border-left-color:none; border-right-color:none; border-bottom-width:0; border-left-width:0; border-right-width:0; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\" />\n-->\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnImageCardBlock\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnImageCardBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"mcnImageCardBlockInner\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-top:9px; padding-right:18px; padding-bottom:9px; padding-left:18px;\">\n                \n*body*\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnDividerBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnDividerBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"mcnDividerBlockInner\" style=\"min-width: 100%; padding: 18px;\">\n                <table class=\"mcnDividerContent\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width: 100%;border-top-width: 4px;border-top-style: solid;border-top-color: #222222;\">\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        <td>\n                            <span></span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n<!--            \n                <td class=\"mcnDividerBlockInner\" style=\"padding: 18px;\">\n                <hr class=\"mcnDividerContent\" style=\"border-bottom-color:none; border-left-color:none; border-right-color:none; border-bottom-width:0; border-left-width:0; border-right-width:0; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\" />\n-->\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnButtonBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnButtonBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"padding-top:0; padding-right:18px; padding-bottom:18px; padding-left:18px;\" valign=\"top\" align=\"center\" class=\"mcnButtonBlockInner\">\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"mcnButtonContentContainer\" style=\"border-collapse: separate !important;border-top-left-radius: 3px;border-top-right-radius: 3px;border-bottom-right-radius: 3px;border-bottom-left-radius: 3px;background-color: #AD0E27;\">\n                    <tbody>\n                        <tr>\n                            <td align=\"center\" valign=\"middle\" class=\"mcnButtonContent\" style=\"font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; padding: 15px;\">\n                                <a class=\"mcnButton \" title=\"Contribute\" href=\"https://integralzen.org/contribute/dana/\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"font-weight: bold;letter-spacing: normal;line-height: 100%;text-align: center;text-decoration: none;color: #FFFFFF;\">Contribute</a>\n                            </td>\n                        </tr>\n                    </tbody>\n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table></td>\n                                        </tr>\n                                    </table>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                            <tr>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" id=\"templateFooter\">\n                                    <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"templateContainer\">\n                                        <tr>\n                                            <td valign=\"top\" class=\"footerContainer\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnFollowBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnFollowBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding:9px\" class=\"mcnFollowBlockInner\">\n                <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnFollowContentContainer\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody><tr>\n        <td align=\"center\" style=\"padding-left:9px;padding-right:9px;\">\n            <table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width:100%;\" class=\"mcnFollowContent\">\n                <tbody><tr>\n                    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" style=\"padding-top:9px; padding-right:9px; padding-left:9px;\">\n                        <table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n                            <tbody><tr>\n                                <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\">\n                                        \n                                            <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"mcnFollowStacked\" style=\"display:inline;\">\n                                                 \n                                                <tbody><tr>\n                                                    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnFollowIconContent\" style=\"padding-right:10px; padding-bottom:9px;\">\n                                                        <a href=\"https://twitter.com/IntegralZen\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://integralzen.org/theme/integralzen/emailtemplates/newsletter-1-assets/color-twitter-96.png\" alt=\"Twitter - Integral Zen\" class=\"mcnFollowBlockIcon\" width=\"48\" style=\"width:48px; max-width:48px; display:block;\"></a>\n                                                    </td>\n                                                </tr>\n                                                \n                                                \n                                            </tbody></table>\n                                        \n                                        \n                                            <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"mcnFollowStacked\" style=\"display:inline;\">\n                                                 \n                                                <tbody><tr>\n                                                    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnFollowIconContent\" style=\"padding-right:10px; padding-bottom:9px;\">\n                                                        <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/IntegralZen/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://integralzen.org/theme/integralzen/emailtemplates/newsletter-1-assets/color-facebook-96.png\" alt=\"Facebook - Integral Zen\" class=\"mcnFollowBlockIcon\" width=\"48\" style=\"width:48px; max-width:48px; display:block;\"></a>\n                                                    </td>\n                                                </tr>\n                                                \n                                                \n                                            </tbody></table>\n                                        \n                                        \n                                            <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"mcnFollowStacked\" style=\"display:inline;\">\n                                                 \n                                                <tbody><tr>\n                                                    <td align=\"center\" valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnFollowIconContent\" style=\"padding-right:10px; padding-bottom:9px;\">\n                                                        <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/user/IntegralZen\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://integralzen.org/theme/integralzen/emailtemplates/newsletter-1-assets/color-youtube-96.png\" alt=\"YouTube - Integral Zen\" class=\"mcnFollowBlockIcon\" width=\"48\" style=\"width:48px; max-width:48px; display:block;\"></a>\n                                                    </td>\n                                                </tr>\n                                                \n                                                \n                                            </tbody></table>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </tbody></table>\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </tbody></table>\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n</tbody></table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnDividerBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnDividerBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td class=\"mcnDividerBlockInner\" style=\"min-width: 100%; padding: 18px;\">\n                <table class=\"mcnDividerContent\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"min-width: 100%;border-top-width: 4px;border-top-style: solid;border-top-color: #222222;\">\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        <td>\n                            <span></span>\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n<!--            \n                <td class=\"mcnDividerBlockInner\" style=\"padding: 18px;\">\n                <hr class=\"mcnDividerContent\" style=\"border-bottom-color:none; border-left-color:none; border-right-color:none; border-bottom-width:0; border-left-width:0; border-right-width:0; margin-top:0; margin-right:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\" />\n-->\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnTextBlock\" style=\"min-width:100%;\">\n    <tbody class=\"mcnTextBlockOuter\">\n        <tr>\n            <td valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnTextBlockInner\" style=\"padding-top:9px;\">\n                <table align=\"left\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"max-width:100%; min-width:100%;\" width=\"100%\" class=\"mcnTextContentContainer\">\n                    <tbody><tr>\n                        \n                        <td valign=\"top\" class=\"mcnTextContent\" style=\"padding: 0px 18px 9px;color: #14308B;font-family: \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, Verdana, sans-serif;font-size: 12px;line-height: 125%;text-align: center;\">\n                        \n                            <div style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>Copyright © 2019 Integralzen, Inc, All rights reserved.</em><br>\n<br>\n<strong>Our mailing address is:</strong><br>\nIntegralzen, Inc<br>\n225 E Bayaud Ave<br>\nDenver, CO 80209-1706<br>\n </div>\n<!--<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"x-webdoc://integralzen.us1.list-manage.com/vcard?u=ba85a7459ffb4e8b62ab95972&id=446e3ab46a\">Add us to your address book</a><br>\n </div>\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Want to change how you receive these emails?<br>\nYou can <a href=\"*|UPDATE_PROFILE|*\">update your preferences</a> or <a href=\"*|UNSUB|*\">unsubscribe from this list</a><br>\n</div>-->\n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                </tbody></table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table></td>\n                                        </tr>\n                                    </table>\n                                </td>\n                            </tr>\n                        </table>\n                        <!-- // END TEMPLATE -->\n                    </td>\n                </tr>\n            </table>\n        </center>\n    </body>\n</html>"
